list.item:
its ends: active, what it is from, and passive, what it is to; for a
        symmetric type, mutual, both ends, once. An end is an id in the file (#hand-A), a
        placeholder, a permalink, or the code of a document or a canon, as source names them ();

its certainty: cert, high, medium or low, for
        certain, probable and possible; none means certain. A disagreement is two relations, not a fourth
        value;
